      </div>

      <div class="dashboard reveal">
        <div class="dial"><div class="num"><span data-count="4">0</span><span>年+</span></div><div class="lab">AI 产品经验</div></div>
        <div class="dial"><div class="num"><span data-count="3">0</span><span>段</span></div><div class="lab">递进式转型攻坚</div></div>
        <div class="dial"><div class="num"><span data-count="20">0</span><span>+</span></div><div class="lab">高保真可交互原型</div></div>
        <div class="dial"><div class="num">¥<span data-count="500">0</span><span>万</span></div><div class="lab">旗舰中台 · 目标年省</div></div>
        <div class="dial"><div class="num"><span data-count="2">0</span><span>次</span></div><div class="lab">集团级战略奖（已获）</div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="km-matrix reveal">
        <div class="km-row">
          <div class="km-cat">降本增效<small>已落地</small></div>
          <div class="km-stats">
            <span><b>降本 13 人</b>客服自动化 80% 重复问题 · 年省百万</span>
            <span><b>月省 ¥5 万</b>C 端 AIGC 内容平台</span>
            <span><b>省百万</b>AIGC 生图替代外采</span>
            <span><b>+60%</b>ERP / 业财融合整体效率</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="km-row">
          <div class="km-cat">AI 效果提升<small>可量化</small></div>
          <div class="km-stats">
            <span><b>68% → 84%</b>客户满意度（智能客服）</span>
            <span><b>65% → 87%</b>生图采纳率（Lora 微调）</span>
